EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}The {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Winter Solstice{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} is over at last.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Wasn't it magical?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0005:}}I hope everyone
gets to enjoy it again next year!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Kış Gündönümü{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} sonunda bitti.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Büyülü bir gün değil miydi?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Umarım gelecek
yıl herkes yeniden yaşayabilir!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Spero che il solstizio d'inverno{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}{{TAG:000E:0010:}} {{TAG:0005:0005:}} ti lasci nel cuore
un meraviglioso ricordo!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Since there's only one day a year
where Mr. Sun doesn't come out,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
it can be rather exciting!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Este es el único día del año
en el que el sol no sale.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
¡Qué emocionante!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}È l'unico giorno all'anno in cui
il sole non appare per niente.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Non è fuffissimo?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Heute ist der einzige Tag im Jahr,
an dem die Sonne nicht scheint.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Ist das nicht aufregend?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bay Güneşin yılda yalnızca bir
gün ortaya çıkmadığını düşününce,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
insan biraz heyecanlanmadan edemiyor!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Quand le soleil reste caché toute la
journée... {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0013:}}eh bien, il fait sacrément
froid !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Dopo che il sole non spunta
per un po'... {{TAG:0003:0013:}}diventa mooolto
freddo!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

DE:
Wenn die Sonne sich so lange
versteckt, {{TAG:0003:0013:}}kann es ganz schön
frostig werden!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Aman,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}bunca yolu gelmişsin.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Bizimle kutlamayı seçtiğin için teşekkürler!
Bugün {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Kış Gündönümü{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} olduğu için{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
bütün gün karanlık!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Es una {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}varita luminosa{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
¿Qué mejor forma de conmemorar
el solsticio de invierno? ¡Es para ti!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Das ist ein {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Leuchtstab{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Behalte ihn als Andenken an den
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Mittwintertag{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} hier in {{TAG:0005:0005:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bu bir {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}ışıklı çubuk{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Kış Gündönümünün{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} anısına senin olsun!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Güneşsiz bu karanlık günde işine
yarar.{{TAG:0003:0026:}}
Üstelik sallaması da eğlenceli!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ho preparato qualcosina di speciale
per il solstizio d'inverno.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Sei curios{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} di vedere cos'è?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}It's a {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}glow wand{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Since it'll be dark all day today,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
I'm sure it'll come in quite handy!
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Just give it a swish now and then!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Das ist ein {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Leuchtstab{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Der ist ganz schön praktisch an
einem so dunklen Tag wie heute!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ciao, sindaco!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Oggi è il {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}solstizio d'inverno{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!
{{TAG:0003:0014:}}... Accifuffoli, che freddo!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Passez une bonne journée ! Ou
devrais-je dire une bonne nuitée ?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Hmm, bonne question{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Zu {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Mittwinter {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}habe ich ein kleines
Geschenk vorbereitet.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Na, bist du schon neugierig?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}It's a {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}glow wand{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Since it'll be nighttime all day,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
I'm sure it'll come in handy!
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Use it to stay safe in the dark!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sindaco,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} non trovi che {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
oggi abbia un aspetto diverso?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Quando la notte è così lunga,
tutto il paesaggio cambia...

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I think I'll take a hot bath today.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}It's been so cold all day that I'd
better do something to warm up!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bugün sıcak bir banyo yapacağım.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bütün gün öyle soğuktu ki iyice
ısınmam şart!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Qui dit {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}solstice d'hiver {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}dit pas de
soleil.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Pas de soleil, pas de chaleur.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Pas de chaleur, risque de rhume !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oggi il sole non apparirà, quindi
la temperatura si abbasserà molto.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Copriti bene, altrimenti ti ammali!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bay Güneş çıkmayınca bugün hava
çok soğuk.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Üşütmemek için sıkı giyinmeyi unutma!
